      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "Aquí tienes la consulta SQL para BigQuery que calcula la distribución y el recuento total de pacientes según el tipo de plan de seguro médico o cobertura de salud:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    c.concept_name AS insurance_plan_type,\n    COUNT(DISTINCT ppp.person_id) AS patient_count,\n    CAST(COUNT(DISTINCT ppp.person_id) * 100.0 / (SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT person_id) FROM payer_plan_period) AS BIGNUMERIC) AS percentage_distribution\nFROM\n    payer_plan_period ppp\nJOIN\n    concept c\nON\n    ppp.payer_concept_id = c.concept_id\nGROUP BY\n    c.concept_name\nORDER BY\n    patient_count DESC;\n```"
          }
        ],
